# Copy this file to .env and paste your own token into the copy.
# .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# To get a token:
#   1. Create a free account at https://www.themoviedb.org/ and verify the email.
#   2. Profile icon -> Settings -> API (left sidebar).
#   3. Request a key: type "Developer", accept the terms, fill the short form.
#      Approval is instant.
#   4. Copy the "API Read Access Token (v4 auth)" — the long value starting eyJ...
#      NOT the 32-character "API Key (v3 auth)". The v4 token travels in a request
#      header, so it never ends up in a URL, a log line or a cached request path.
#
# No quotes, no spaces around the =, no trailing whitespace.

TMDB_BEARER_TOKEN=paste_your_v4_read_access_token_here
